<title>JAPAN: Shugakusha - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Shugakusha - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.68		vs	    1.73</p>
<p> Operating	  349    million    vs	  327    million</p>
